          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.662,
            0.402,
            0.68
          ],
          "content": "Ans. (+2) + (-3) = -1; Toy store."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.689,
            0.881,
            0.725
          ],
          "content": "Q.2. Evaluate these expressions (you may think of them as Starting Floor + Movement by referring to the Building of Fun)."
